## 一、定义 / 1. Definitions

**本软件**：指以本仓库（https://github.com/minmindme/Genesis）形式发布的 Genesis 同构数据引擎的全部内容及其后续版本，包括但不限于：源代码、构建产物、文档（白皮书、更新日志、语义规格、展示页）、SQL 脚本、测试用例、前端资产、图标与文本。

**THE SOFTWARE**: The entire contents of the Genesis Isomorphic Data Engine as published in this repository (https://github.com/minmindme/Genesis) and any subsequent versions, including but not limited to: source code, build artifacts, documentation, SQL scripts, test cases, front-end assets, icons, and text.

**署名**：以显著方式注明本软件的来源，最低限度包含：① 版权声明"© 2026 minmindme"；② 本仓库地址 https://github.com/minmindme/Genesis；③ 本许可协议的链接。

**Attribution**: Clearly indicating the origin of the Software, minimally including: (a) the copyright notice "© 2026 minmindme"; (b) the repository URL https://github.com/minmindme/Genesis; (c) a link to this license.

**用户内容**：您通过本软件发表、上传、写入、存储或转载的任何数据与内容，包括但不限于：业务数据、文本、结构、指令与配置。

**User Content**: Any data and content you publish, upload, write, store, or repost through the Software, including but not limited to business data, text, structures, instructions, and configurations.

